	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Listen & Notify]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8403#p8403"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Pour avoir une réponse synchrone il suffit d&#039;ajouter cette ligne dans la chaine de connexion<br />&#160; &#160;SyncNotification=true<br />Voir ce lien&#160; &#160; de Francisco Figueiredo Jr&#160; &#160; <a href="http://fxjr.blogspot.com/2006/04/synchronous-notification-explained.html" rel="nofollow">http://fxjr.blogspot.com/2006/04/synchr … ained.html</a></p><p>Thursday, April 13, 2006<br />Synchronous notification explained </p><p>Hi all,</p><p>it seems that my coined feature name &quot;synchronous notification&quot; is confusing everybody. I hope to explain it better now.<br />.....<br />It is disabled by default. You can enable it by specifying SyncNotification=true in your connection string.</p>]]></content>
